VED":"Observado","UNKNOWN":"Desconocido","HTTP_EXPOSED":"Por HTTP","LOCAL_ONLY_ADMIN":"Solo administración local","The Mac Keychain could not store or read this Workspace binding.":"El llavero Mac no pudo guardar o leer esta vinculación Workspace.","The saved Workspace binding is invalid. Forget it explicitly to start again.":"La vinculación Workspace guardada no es válida. Olvídela explícitamente para empezar de nuevo.","A token was saved without a Server binding. Forget it explicitly before pairing again.":"Se guardó un token sin vinculación al servidor. Olvídelo antes de volver a vincular.","Enter a Server address without a path, query or credentials.":"Introduzca una dirección de servidor sin ruta, consulta ni credenciales.","A Server outside this Mac requires HTTPS.":"Un servidor fuera de este Mac requiere HTTPS.","The Server identity differs from the saved binding. Forget it explicitly before pairing another Server.":"La identidad del servidor difiere de la vinculación guardada. Olvídela antes de vincular otro servidor.","The Server rejected the token.":"El servidor rechazó el token.","The Server returned an invalid or inconsistent response.":"El servidor devolvió una respuesta inválida o incoherente.","The Server is unavailable. The last successful observation remains labelled with its time.":"El servidor no está disponible. La última observación correcta conserva su fecha.","This Mac does not trust the Server's HTTPS certificate or its name. Check the Server address and certificate in macOS.":"Este Mac no confía en el certificado HTTPS o nombre del servidor. Compruebe la dirección y el certificado en macOS.","The secure connection to the Server failed. Check its HTTPS configuration and try again.":"La conexión segura al servidor falló. Compruebe la configuración HTTPS e inténtelo de nuevo.","The Server did not respond before the connection timed out. Check the Server and try again.":"El servidor no respondió antes del límite de tiempo. Compruébelo e inténtelo de nuevo.","Enter the Server token.":"Introduzca el token del servidor.","The Server address differs from the saved binding. Forget it explicitly before changing Server.":"La dirección del servidor difiere de la vinculación guardada. Olvídela antes de cambiar de servidor.","The Server returned HTTP":"El servidor devolvió HTTP","Last successful read":"Última lectura correcta","Displayed data is cached.":"Los datos mostrados están en caché.","AVAILABLE":"Disponible","SOURCE_UNAVAILABLE":"Fuente no disponible","FRESH":"Actual","WRONG_INSTANCE":"Instancia incorrecta"],
    ]
    static func text(_ key:String,language:String?=nil) -> String {
        values[language ?? WorkspaceLanguage.current]?[key] ?? values["en"]?[key] ?? key
    }
    static func detail(_ detail:String,language:String?=nil) -> String {
        if detail.hasPrefix("Fresh Server read at ") { return text("Fresh Server read",language:language) }
        let pieces=detail.components(separatedBy:" Last successful read: ")
        let message=pieces[0]
        var result:String
        if message.hasPrefix("The Server returned HTTP "),message.hasSuffix(".") {
            result=text("The Server returned HTTP",language:language)+" "+message.dropFirst(25)
        } else { result=text(message,language:language) }
        if pieces.count==2,let end=pieces[1].range(of:"; displayed data is cached.") {
            result += " "+text("Last successful read",language:language)+": "+pieces[1][..<end.lowerBound]+"; "+text("Displayed data is cached.",language:language)
        }
        return result
    }
}
